  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Many times, players have complained about the issue surrounding the long wait for every username change. My suggestion that even if a month is taken off the time, to decrease it. Another suggestion is that a VRC+ feature can be put that decreases it even more. Maybe 2-1 months by default and even less for subscribers? I think players will be more willing to pay for the subscription considering this has been an annoyance for a while and those without will still be at least a bit satisfied.",
